BillGates Foundation Award for an Indian Girl Against Child Marriage.
A 17-year-old girl from Rajasthan has been honoured with the "ChangeMaker" by the Bill Gates Foundation for his fight against child marriage and child labour.
Payal Jankid (17) hails from Hinsla village, 100 km from Jaipur, Rajasthan.
