"There have been a lot of problems in our village.
In particular, the girls will not be allowed to study outside.
They get married at an early age.
When I was a child, my family decided to get married.
At that time, I reached out to a social worker and pacified my father.
Since then, there have been a lot of protests and protests against the child's marriage.
We've come to every home and make everyone aware of this.
Every child should be given an opportunity to improve their lives."
